                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-people"></i><span><strong>Team:</strong> 1 designer, 2 engineers</span></div>
                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-layers"></i><span><strong>Stack:</strong> Laravel, React, Tailwind, MySQL</span></div>
