            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
              <h3>Version Awareness</h3>
              <p>Design outputs required clearer history and review context.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
              <h3>Workflow Speed</h3>
              <p>Production teams could not be slowed down by administrative friction.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
              <h3>Cross-Team Use</h3>
              <p>Design and content contributors needed the same source of truth for assets.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section-accent">
